n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Societies","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/kalpataru-aurum/129646/project","title":"Kalpataru Aurum, Baner, Pune | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Kalpataru developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Kalpataru Aurum Baner, Pune\n\n![Kalpataru Aurum Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Virtual Tour](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/129646__154022/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-aurum-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.19 Cr - 1.69 Cr**\n\n₹11,744 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Kalpataru Aurum?\n\n## About Kalpataru Aurum, Baner by Kalpataru\n\n## Kalpataru Aurum Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Kalpataru Aurum.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  850 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.19 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  841 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.33 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  980 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.39 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1190 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.69 Cr** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nKalpataru Aurum's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Baner.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Kalpataru Aurum | Baner |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 20700 | 16450 |\n| Mar 2026 | 20650 | 15700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 15550 | 15500 |\n| Sep 2025 | 13750 | 14400 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nKalpataru Aurum avg. price is ₹ 20.7 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Baner at ₹ 16.4 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Kalpataru Aurum** | ₹ 20,700 |\n| Baner | ₹ 16,450 |\n| [Mantra The Midas Residences](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/mantra-the-midas-residences/176665/project \"Mantra The Midas Residences\") | ₹ 14,950 |\n| [Rohan Ekam](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/rohan-ekam/229491/project \"Rohan Ekam\") | ₹ 14,850 |\n| [VTP Sierra](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/vtp-sierra/103239/project \"VTP Sierra\") | ₹ 14,600 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Baner ranges from ₹ 19.5 K to ₹ 2.3 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4,5 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Kalpataru Aurum | In Baner |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 23.9 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 36.9 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 47.3 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n| 5 BHK | - | ₹ 2.3 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Kalpataru Aurum.\n\n#### Pune Ring Road Eastern extn Gets Green Light :₹10,502 Cr Project\n\nMaharashtra Cabinet Committee has approved the revised cost of ₹10,502.36 crore for the eastern extension of the Pune Ring Road. This 31.805-km controlled-access expressway aims to divert traffic away from Pune city. With 80% of land acquisition complete, the project is slated for completion by June 2029\n\n#### Mandatory Safety Systems for School Transport Vehicles in Pune\n\nCCTV, live tracking, and fire-safety systems are now mandatory for school transport vehicles in Pune. This regulatory update aims to enhance the safety and security of students commuting to and from school, potentially reducing accidents and improving emergency response capabilities.\n\n#### Pune Metro Infrastructure to be Integrated with Upcoming Road Corridors\n\nMSIDC and Pune Metro are set to sign MoUs to integrate Metro infrastructure with two upcoming road projects. Approximately 7.7 km of the Kharadi-Shirur elevated corridor and 17 km of the Hadapsar-Yavat elevated corridor will be developed as double-decker structures, with the upper deck designed to accommodate future Metro lines.\n\n#### Maharashtra Brace for Intense Monsoon: Heavy Rains Cause Infrastructure Damage and Disruptions\n\nPune experienced heavy rainfall on July 5, 2026, leading to significant disruptions and infrastructure damage. A compound wall of a residential society collapsed, damaging 14 vehicles, though no injuries were reported. The India Meteorological Department (IMD) issued an orange alert for Pune and a red alert for Mumbai, forecasting continued heavy to extremely heavy rainfall across Maharashtra.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway Widening Project Moves Forward with Revised Funding Plan\n\nThe Maharashtra State Road Development Corporation (MSRDC) has submitted a revised funding plan to the state government for the expansion of the Mumbai-Pune Expressway to 10 lanes. If approved this year, the project will be tendered under BOT model, with construction expected to begin next year and conclude by 2030.\n\n#### Pune Railway Station Overhaul: Rs 473 Crore Project to Add Six New Platforms\n\nPune Junction is set for a major overhaul with a Rs 473 crore project that includes yard remodelling and the addition of six new platforms. This expansion aims to increase the station's capacity to handle more trains and passengers, improving overall efficiency and passenger experience.\n\n#### Pune Metro Line 3: Hinjewadi-Baner Stations to Open by July 15, Full Operations by December 2026\n\nThe first phase of Pune Metro Line 3, covering 12 stations between Maan (Hinjewadi) and Ramnagar (Baner), is slated to become operational by July 15, 2026. The remaining stations, including Shivajinagar, are expected to open by August, with the entire line operating at full capacity by December 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Kalpataru Aurum moved from ₹ 20,650/sqft to ₹ 20,700/sqft, reflecting a 0.24% rise.\n\n#### Pune Metro Line 3 to Commence Operations by June 15, Connecting Hinjewadi to Shivajinagar\n\nPune Metro's elevated Line 3, spanning 23.203 km and connecting Hinjewadi to Shivajinagar, will begin operations in phases starting June 15, 2026. The first phase will cover 12 stations from the Hinjewadi side, with the remaining stations expected to be operational by October.\n\n#### Hinjewadi-Shivajinagar Metro Line Nears Launch, Operations to Begin in Phases\n\nThe 23-km Hinjewadi-Shivajinagar Metro corridor is nearing completion, with the first 11-km stretch expected to become operational in May 2026 and the remaining 12-km section in July 2026. This phased launch is due to ongoing work at several stations and safety approvals. The project,aims to improve connectivity between Pune's IT hub and the city center.\n\n## Kalpataru Aurum Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 841 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kalpataru Aurum, Pune](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/129646__154021/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.33 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 850 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kalpataru Aurum, Pune](https://img-floorplans.squareyards.com/129646__154022/isometric_floorplan.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.19 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 980 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kalpataru Aurum, Pune](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.39 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1190 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Kalpataru Aurum, Pune](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.69 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Kalpataru Aurum\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Kalpataru Aurum to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Kalpataru Aurum Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-aurum-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure & master plan of Kalpataru Aurum to explore floor plans and layout details in Baner, Pune.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Kalpataru Aurum Baner | Teaser- Pricing, Offers, Plans | Kalpataru Baner Project](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GmeMy07tCPY/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Baner | Launching Kalpataru Aurum Baner - 2 BHK's for 99 Lacs* | Doorstep Space](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/B3srHB1MzwU/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Kalpataru Aurum Baner Pune | New Launch 2 ,3 & 4 BHK Homes | Starting From 99 Lacs | Quick Review](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kMbFqT37CDI/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Kalpataru Aurum\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-rainwate-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Kalpataru Baner\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Pune West](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Kalpataru Aurum.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Kalpataru Aurum](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/project-image/kalpataru-aurum-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Creative Minds School\n\n#### Sai Shilp Business Center\n\n#### Vithoba Balaji Murkute Garden\n\n#### Dhanwantari Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Baner\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nThe locality’s development has picked up pace after coming under the administration of the BBMP.\n\nThe locality is prone to traffic congestion during Rapid depletion of groundwater due to increased demand for residence and office space has caused severe water scarcity.peak day hours.\n\nLiving in Baner, I am content with my daily routine here. This site's energy appeals to me; it seems quite modern. Mostly traveling Baner Road, I may quickly get to Hinjewadi and Aundh. Even in the evening, I feel secure wandering about; nearby cafés and food outlets are a pleasure for me. I am aware that schools like VIBGYOR and Orchid are simple to reach from Jupiter Hospital. I like morning walks along open green stretches near Baner Hill. I like how near to me are daily stores, fitness centers, and marketplaces. For life here to be easier, traffic management and enhanced road maintenance in inner lanes really have to get better urgently.\n\n— Santosh, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Kalpataru Aurum\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2025-07-16 | Floor 9, Unit 93 | A1 | 317 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Kalpataru Aurum compare with similar projects?\n\n![Kalpataru Aurum project in Baner, Pune](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-aurum-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Kalpataru Aurum](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/kalpataru-aurum/129646/project \"Kalpataru Aurum\")\n\nBaner, Pune\n\n![Majestique Signature Towers Phase 1 project in Balewadi, Pune](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/tn-projectflagship/tn-majestique-signature-towers-phase-1-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Majestique Signature Towers Phase 1](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/majestique-signature-towers-phase-1/100468/project \"Majestique Signature Towers Phase 1\")\n\nBalewadi, Pune\n\n![VTP Sierra project in Baner, Pune](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/pune/tn-projectflagship/tn-vtp-sierra-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [VTP Sierra](https://www.squareyards.com/pune-residential-property/vtp-sierra/103239/project \"VTP Sierra\")\n\nBaner, Pune\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Kalpataru Aurum Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Kalpataru Aurum located at Baner Pune and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI suggest Aurum to customers who want a balance of eco-luxury. The rooftop deck, children's pool, and others provide convenience.\n\nOwner\n\nThe project's eco-features are a great advantage. Baner's potential for growth appears robust.\n\nOwner\n\nI prefer this budget-friendly 2 BHK entry price of ₹1.3 cr with contemporary amenities.\n\nOwner\n\nSome fittings looked basic in sample flat, not the premium quality expected at cost point.\n\nOwner\n\nThe landscaped park and rooftop viewing platform impressed me on my visit. Nearby traffic is a concern.\n\n## Kalpataru Track Record\n\n![Kalpataru logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nA top dog on the list of the best real estate developers in India, Kalpataru Group has been creating beautifully crafted homes and well planned locations in India since 1969.\nOne of the top real estate firms in India was founded in 1969 and is called Kalpataru Limited. Kalpataru, a recipient of numerous international honours for quality and design, has built iconic structures that have advanced real estate development standards for nearly 50 years. From pioneering the idea of 1.5 bedroom residences to developing Asia's first and the sixth Platinum LEED certified commercial building to being among the first to implement eco-friendly construction practices, Kalpataru's buildings are today ever-expanding dynamic lifespaces for thousands of content families. In the 1970s, Kalpataru built Mumbai's tallest residential skyscraper, a record that remained for the next quarter of a century.\nKalpataru Limited conducts business in real estate development. The business creates integrated townships, retail locations, and commercial and residential properties in addition to offering logistical, civil infrastructure, and power distribution and transmission services. India is the primary market for Kalpataru.\nThe development and construction of upscale residential towers, townships, gated communities, and commercial buildings have been Kalpataru Limited's specialty for more than 50 years. Their extensive legacy is attested to by their more than 100 awards and accolades.\nTh